    "abstract": "Parts list for the brake and steering control unit installation in the centre gear bay, covering the unit mounting, the pressure regulator, the accumulator and the sense line clamping.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the detail parts of the brake and steering control unit installation in the centre gear bay, including the pressure regulator and the brake accumulator.",
      "figure_note": "The unit itself is a vendor-supplied item and is not detailed here; the figure covers its installation hardware. Sheet 1 shows the unit mounting and the electrical connections and sheet 2 shows the hydraulic manifold and the sense line run. The clamp at item 30 is added on aircraft that have had the pressure regulator replaced, and its position differs from the earlier clamp shown at item 30A."
    },
